      "font size" : 8.966,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "[47] In particular, since we will always assume the use of a mass independent renormalization scheme, we may compute a3 with all external mass scales (= sources) equal to zero. Said otherwise, a3 is completely determined by the dynamics of the original Yang-Mills action, in which case it is known to vanish to all orders [41].",
